OL,3,GNEWSAEx-rough sleeper urges more
OL,4,Asupport after rehousing
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A lot of people think that when you
OL,7,Fare homeless you are on your own, but
OL,8,Fyou're not," says former rough sleeper
OL,9,FDean Nicholls.
OL,11,F"There's other homeless people, and
OL,12,Fit's the togetherness with them that
OL,13,Fhelps you get through it."
OL,15,FFor three years, Nicholls slept rough
OL,16,Fon the streets of Stafford, relying on
OL,17,Fthe support of others facing the same
OL,18,Fstruggles.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
