OL,3,GNEWSAEx-rough sleeper urges more
OL,4,Asupport after rehousing
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow living in supported accommodation,
OL,7,Fhe is trying to rebuild his life after
OL,8,Fa series of setbacks that included the
OL,9,Fdeath of his mother, the loss of his
OL,10,Fjob, the breakdown of a relationship
OL,11,Fand an addiction to drugs.
